Some friendly repos for making contributions with little or no code:

"Awesome Lists" are repos with lists of awesome things related to a particular topic. This Repo https://github.com/sindresorhus/awesome is an awesome list of awesome lists!
First-Timers' Guide https://github.com/the-ethan-hunt/first-timers-guideis a repo for first timers to contribute short, single page guides on a variety of tech-related topics.
